# Dev-only artifacts. The e2e suites in .shots/*.mjs stay tracked; the
# screenshots they write are regenerated on every run.
.shots/*.png
# The 7MB concept mockup source stays local; docs/concept-mockup.jpg is the
# compressed copy the README links.
reference/
# Local Claude Code launch config (CLAUDE.md itself stays tracked).
.claude/

# NOTE: assets/ is intentionally TRACKED (essential project files).
# Revisit Git LFS only if total assets exceed ~50MB.
